# The build context is the repository root, because the server depends on
# packages/ that sit beside it. Without this file Docker would ship the whole
# repo — the Flutter app, the git history, every build output — into the
# builder just to compile one binary.
#
# The `.dart_tool` exclusions matter for more than speed: those directories
# hold a package_config.json written with absolute host paths, and copying one
# into the image points the container's package resolution at directories that
# do not exist there.
.git
.github
.dart_tool/
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
app/
docs/
*.md
docker-compose.yml
**/.packages
**/.flutter-plugins*
